{"content":"{\n  \"status\": \"needs_information\",\n  \"objectives\": {\n    \"primary\": [\n      {\n        \"text\": \"在FLT3突变阳性（FLT3-ITD或FLT3-TKD）初治（1L）AML患者中，证明合成药Y（RP2D每日一次口服，28天为一个给药周期）联合BSC相较外观匹配安慰剂联合BSC在复合完全缓解率（CRc）上优效。\",\n        \"basis\": \"user\",\n        \"reason\": \"用户确认研究人群、随机双盲安慰剂对照、单药口服加BSC、II期、主要终点CRc及优效性比较。\",\n        \"references\": []\n      }\n    ],\n    \"secondary\": [\n      {\n        \"text\": \"评估总生存期（OS）：从随机化到任何原因死亡的时间，比较两组OS。\",\n        \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n        \"reason\": \"CRc为短期缓解指标，FLT3突变AML的长期获益需OS支持；未在确认事实中指定，作为推荐次要目标。\",\n        \"references\": []\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"评估无复发生存期（RFS）和/或缓解持续时间（DoR）。\",\n        \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n        \"reason\": \"用于评估CRc是否转化为持久缓解；II期样本量下可能仅作描述性或探索性分析，除非预先控制多重性。\",\n        \"references\": []\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"评估MRD阴性率：在方案/SAP预设时间点比较两组可评估患者的MRD阴性比例。\",\n        \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n        \"reason\": \"MRD阴性是AML缓解深度和长期结局的重要指标；具体检测方法、时间点和阈值需预先定义。\",\n        \"references\": [\n          {\n            \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-94dcaabffc31982300e8f839b9ce36bf43eaa4902d32e53379bbf5c2bc4fa054\",\n            \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/165\",\n            \"quote\": \"The primary modality is multiparameter flow cytometry (MFC) with a sensitivity target of 10⁻4 (minimum 10⁻3 acceptable), and error-corrected NGS is a key secondary method. Bone marrow aspirates are collected at d14 ± 2 and d28 ± 7. MRD negativity is defined as < 0.1% leukemic cells by MFC or below the limit of detection (≤ 10⁻4 VAF) by NGS.\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"评估安全性与耐受性：AE、SAE、导致停药或剂量调整的毒性、治疗相关死亡等。\",\n        \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n        \"reason\": \"II期需同步评价FLT3抑制剂单药在初治AML中的安全性；具体安全性终点需在方案中预先定义。\",\n        \"references\": []\n      }\n    ],\n    \"questions\": []\n  },\n  \"endpoint\": {\n    \"primary_endpoint\": {\n      \"text\": \"主要终点为CRc，推荐定义为在主要评估时间点达到CR、CRi或MLFS（按ELN 2022标准）的患者比例；在ITT人群中比较合成药Y+BSC与安慰剂+BSC的优效性。\",\n      \"basis\": \"user\",\n      \"reason\": \"用户确认主要终点为CRc、优效性比较、ITT分析；CR/CRi/MLFS的具体构成和评估时间点未在输入中确认，需按下方问题固定。\",\n      \"references\": [\n        {\n          \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-94dcaabffc31982300e8f839b9ce36bf43eaa4902d32e53379bbf5c2bc4fa054\",\n          \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/139\",\n          \"quote\": \"The primary endpoint of this study is CRc. CRc rate defined as the proportion of patients with Complete remission (CR), Complete remission with incomplete blood count recovery (CRi) or Morphological leukemia-free state (MLFS) in all evaluable patients. For the primary endpoint analysis, participants with missing bone-marrow assessments, those who experience early withdrawal, or who die will be considered as non-responders (i.e., treatment failures).\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"measurement_details\": \"推荐在方案/SAP中固定主要评估时间点，例如首剂后第56天±7天或第2周期第28天±7天；采用骨髓形态学评估CRc，评估者对治疗分配保持盲态；缺失骨髓评估、早期退出或死亡按非缓解处理；主要分析在ITT人群进行。\",\n    \"key_secondary\": [\n      {\n        \"text\": \"MRD阴性率：在预设时间点比较两组MRD阴性比例，MRD方法和阈值需在方案/SAP中预先固定。\",\n        \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n        \"reason\": \"MRD是AML缓解深度的重要次要终点；具体方法、时间点和阈值未确认，需预先定义以避免分析偏倚。\",\n        \"references\": []\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"RFS和/或DoR：评估缓解持久性。\",\n        \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n        \"reason\": \"CRc为主要终点，RFS/DoR可支持临床获益解释；需注意II期样本量下可能仅为描述性或探索性。\",\n        \"references\": []\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"OS：从随机化到任何原因死亡的时间。\",\n        \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n        \"reason\": \"OS是AML关键长期结局；是否作为关键次要终点取决于样本量和随访时间，需预先指定多重性策略。\",\n        \"references\": []\n      }\n    ],\n    \"questions\": [\n      \"主要CRc评估时间点采用什么时点（例如首剂后28天、第2周期第28天或诱导治疗结束）？\",\n      \"CRc的构成采用CR+CRi、CR+CRi+MLFS还是其他组合？\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"estimand\": {\n    \"treatment\": {\n      \"text\": \"合成药Y（RP2D，每日一次口服，28天为一个给药周期）联合BSC，对照为外观匹配的安慰剂胶囊（相同每日一次给药频次和每次粒数）联合BSC；随机、双盲、多中心。\",\n      \"basis\": \"user\",\n      \"reason\": \"用户确认研究药、安慰剂匹配方式、两组均接受BSC、给药频次和28天周期。\",\n      \"references\": []\n    },\n    \"population\": {\n      \"text\": \"FLT3突变阳性（FLT3-ITD或FLT3-TKD）初治（1L）AML患者；ITT人群为所有随机化患者，按随机分组分析。\",\n      \"basis\": \"user\",\n      \"reason\": \"用户确认研究人群和ITT分析人群；FLT3-ITD等位基因比阈值、检测方法和分层界值未确认。\",\n      \"references\": []\n    },\n    \"variable\": {\n      \"text\": \"在主要评估时间点的CRc二元应答状态（CR/CRi/MLFS，推荐按ELN 2022标准）。\",\n      \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n      \"reason\": \"用户确认CRc为主要终点；具体应答构成和时间点需由方案/SAP固定。\",\n      \"references\": [\n        {\n          \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-94dcaabffc31982300e8f839b9ce36bf43eaa4902d32e53379bbf5c2bc4fa054\",\n          \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/139\",\n          \"quote\": \"The primary endpoint of this study is CRc. CRc rate defined as the proportion of patients with Complete remission (CR), Complete remission with incomplete blood count recovery (CRi) or Morphological leukemia-free state (MLFS) in all evaluable patients. For the primary endpoint analysis, participants with missing bone-marrow assessments, those who experience early withdrawal, or who die will be considered as non-responders (i.e., treatment failures).\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"ice_events\": [\n      \"主要评估时间点前死亡\",\n      \"早期退出或失访\",\n      \"主要评估时间点前缺失骨髓评估\",\n      \"主要评估时间点前启动后续抗白血病治疗\",\n      \"主要评估时间点前终止研究治疗\"\n    ],\n    \"ice_strategy\": {\n      \"text\": \"主估计目标采用复合策略：发生上述ICE者，在主要分析中计为无应答。\",\n      \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n      \"reason\": \"与ITT和CRc率分析一致，可避免后续治疗或缺失数据高估疗效；需在SAP预先定义，并可用治疗政策或假设策略作敏感性分析。\",\n      \"references\": [\n        {\n          \"source_artifact_id\": \"source-94dcaabffc31982300e8f839b9ce36bf43eaa4902d32e53379bbf5c2bc4fa054\",\n          \"locator\": \"word/document.xml/body/139\",\n          \"quote\": \"For the primary endpoint analysis, participants with missing bone-marrow assessments, those who experience early withdrawal, or who die will be considered as non-responders (i.e., treatment failures).\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"summary_measure\": {\n      \"text\": \"试验组与安慰剂组的CRc率差（试验组-安慰剂组）及其双侧95% CI；优效性检验推荐用分层CMH检验或调整分层因素的logistic回归。\",\n      \"basis\": \"recommendation\",\n      \"reason\": \"适用于二分类主要终点和随机分层设计；分层因素应包括中心及FLT3-ITD等位基因比分层（界值需在方案中预先指定）。\",\n      \"references\": []\n    },\n    \"questions\": [\n      \"FLT3-ITD等位基因比的阳性阈值和检测方法是什么（如NGS、PCR，VAF/AR阈值）？\",\n      \"按FLT3-ITD等位基因比分层的界值是什么？\",\n      \"分层因素除研究中心和FLT3-ITD等位基因比外，是否还包括FLT3突变类型（ITD vs TKD）或其他预后因素？\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"sample_size\": {\n    \"assumptions\": [\n      \"主要终点为CRc，优效性设计，ITT分析。\",\n      \"场景A：安慰剂+BSC的CRc=10%，合成药Y+BSC的CRc=35%，率差25个百分点。\",\n      \"场景B：安慰剂+BSC的CRc=20%，合成药Y+BSC的CRc=45%，率差25个百分点。\",\n      \"两组按1:1随机。\",\n      \"主要分析采用两独立样本率比较；若考虑分层因素，可用分层CMH检验或调整分层因素的logistic回归。\",\n      \"脱落或不可评价率按10%计。\"\n    ],\n    \"alpha\": \"双侧0.05（等价于单侧0.025）\",\n    \"power\": \"80%\",\n    \"model\": \"两独立样本率比较的正态近似/χ²检验；主要分析推荐用调整研究中心及FLT3-ITD等位基因比分层因素的CMH检验或logistic回归。\",\n    \"planned_n\": \"场景A：每组可评价约43例，总可评价86例，含10%脱落共96例（每组48例）。场景B：每组可评价约54例，总可评价108例，含10%脱落共120例（每组60例）。最终样本量需根据实际预期CRc假设锁定。\",\n    \"attrition\": \"10%\",\n    \"justification\": \"按两独立样本率比较公式，双侧α=0.05、power=80%、1:1随机、率差25个百分点：场景A每方可评价约43例，场景B约54例；加10%脱落后分别约96例和120例。样本量对安慰剂组CRc假设高度敏感，需在获得I期剂量和真实背景缓解数据后最终确定。\",\n    \"questions\": [\n      \"合成药Y+BSC和安慰剂+BSC的预期CRc分别是多少（包括FLT3-ITD与FLT3-TKD亚组的预期）？\",\n      \"预期脱落或不可评价率采用10%还是其他值？\"\n    ],\n    \"references\": []\n  },\n  \"interim_planning\": null,\n  \"non_inferiority_margin\": null,\n  \"questions\": [\n    \"合成药Y的具体mg剂量和RP2D是什么（由I期剂量探索确定）？\",\n    \"FLT3-ITD等位基因比的阳性阈值和检测方法是什么（如NGS/PCR、VAF/AR阈值）？\",\n    \"按FLT3-ITD等位基因比分层的界值是什么？\",\n    \"主要CRc评估时间点采用什么时点（例如首剂后28天、第2周期第28天或诱导治疗结束）？\",\n    \"CRc的构成采用CR+CRi、CR+CRi+MLFS还是其他组合？\",\n    \"合成药Y+BSC与安慰剂+BSC的预期CRc分别是多少（用于优效性样本量估算）？\"\n  ],\n  \"unresolved_questions\": []\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"design-elements.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"design-elements-intake","sha256":"6b7c54f2a8b51c6be0e75d8740574dba2ed93c8e4af0381a311fe2d21ab32e46"}],"logical_call_id":"call:design-elements:6380cdbb1a4df0f6ae9bc6438c0a4cc16ec3460c8e0134aaf1bd92ba152d9784:design-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:design-elements:6380cdbb1a4df0f6ae9bc6438c0a4cc16ec3460c8e0134aaf1bd92ba152d9784:design-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/design-elements-output.v1.json","output_sha256":"e3b5e32fd296b5b54e9e6d0e51a656741b70b94d55c42e1bde862240f4e0faaf","prompt_sha256":"21bf2955294ee9cc2fd35ad41a9fec8e8279bf3e566b47d7babf7c624d527a38","provider_session_id":"42b41958-a76a-42de-abaf-fb5a45b4f61e","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},"schema":"model_response.v1"}